WEBVTT

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Alissa
by C. J. MOORE

00:19.600 --> 00:21.500
Alissa is reading.  

00:21.600 --> 00:26.800
Her father calls to her. Alissa? Alissa?
  
00:27.000 --> 00:28.950
Alissa runs to the door.

00:29.000 --> 00:32.500
There is a car outside the house.

00:32.600 --> 00:35.000
Her father is talking to a fat man.

00:35.100 --> 00:41.380
"This is Alissa. She reads all day." Her father says. 

00:41.400 --> 00:47.800
The two men laugh. HHHHHHH... Alissa?
  
00:47.900 --> 00:52.500
Her father says, "My friend has work for you in the city."

00:52.600 --> 00:57.950
"There isn't any work here in the village. You must go with him."

00:58.000 --> 01:01.950
The fat man smiles at Alissa.

01:02.000 --> 01:05.650
How old are you? He asks.
 
01:06.000 --> 01:08.300
I'm 12. She says. 

01:08.400 --> 01:10.950
The fat man laughs again.

01:11.000 --> 01:15.650
Alissa doesn't like him. She doesn't want to go with this man.

01:16.000 --> 01:18.550
She wants to go to school in the village.

01:19.000 --> 01:22.950
She likes school. She likes reading.

01:23.000 --> 01:25.950
Your mother is packing your things.

01:26.000 --> 01:29.950
You must go to the city, her father says.

01:30.000 --> 01:33.950
The fat man gives some money to Alissa's father.

01:34.000 --> 01:36.950
Alissa's father is pleased and happy.

01:37.000 --> 01:40.400
Alissa is angry and afraid.

01:40.500 --> 01:49.950
Alissa does not want to go with this man, but she must obey her father.

01:50.000 --> 01:53.320
Alissa and the fat man arrive in the city.

01:53.800 --> 01:55.950
They drive to a house.

01:56.000 --> 01:58.550
A thin man comes to the door.

01:58.800 --> 02:00.950
The two men talk.

02:01.000 --> 02:02.950
Here is your room.

02:03.000 --> 02:05.950
The thin man says to Alissa.

02:06.000 --> 02:08.950
He points to a door under the steps.

02:09.000 --> 02:11.950
Alissa goes into the room.

02:12.000 --> 02:14.950
The room is small and dark.

02:15.000 --> 02:16.950
It is her new home.

02:17.500 --> 02:21.950
The next morning, the thin man takes Alissa into the house.

02:22.000 --> 02:23.950
This is Alissa.

02:24.000 --> 02:25.950
The man says to his wife.

02:26.000 --> 02:32.950
She likes reading. They laugh. Hahaha.
  
02:33.000 --> 02:35.950
Suddenly, the woman shouts at Alissa.

02:36.000 --> 02:40.300
You aren't going to read here. She shouts.
 
02:40.500 --> 02:44.600
You're going to cook and clean and wash.

02:44.700 --> 02:47.950
Alissa works 15 hours a day.

02:48.000 --> 02:50.950
The woman shouts at her every day.

02:51.000 --> 02:52.950
Alissa is very unhappy.

02:53.000 --> 02:57.950
She cries every night.

02:58.000 --> 03:01.450
One day, the thin man says to Alissa.

03:01.700 --> 03:04.950
Pack your things. You must go.
  
03:05.000 --> 03:06.950
My wife doesn't like you.

03:07.000 --> 03:10.950
The thin man takes her to a clothes shop in the city.

03:11.000 --> 03:13.950
The shop owner is a large woman.

03:14.000 --> 03:16.950
She gives the man some money.

03:17.000 --> 03:18.250
He goes away.

03:18.700 --> 03:22.000
He doesn't say goodbye to Alissa.

03:28.000 --> 03:30.950
Alissa works with five other girls.

03:31.000 --> 03:34.950
They work in a small, dark room.

03:35.000 --> 03:37.950
The girls work all day.

03:38.000 --> 03:39.950
They make clothes.

03:40.000 --> 03:42.950
They work 12 hours a day.

03:43.000 --> 03:46.080
At midday, they eat lunch.

03:47.000 --> 03:50.050
After lunch, they rest for 10 minutes.

03:50.900 --> 03:54.000
At night, they sleep on the floor.

03:58.000 --> 04:02.950
Each month, the shop owner gives the girls a little money.

04:03.000 --> 04:06.950
Alissa buys a book with her money.

04:07.000 --> 04:09.950
She reads the book after lunch.

04:10.000 --> 04:12.950
The shop owner is surprised.

04:13.000 --> 04:15.950
The other girls can't read.

04:16.000 --> 04:17.950
Can you write?

04:18.000 --> 04:19.650
Can you count?

04:19.800 --> 04:21.950
The shop owner asks.

04:22.000 --> 04:25.950
Yes, I can. Alissa says.
 
04:26.000 --> 04:29.950
Come. The shop owner says.
  
04:30.000 --> 04:33.000
You are going to work in the shop.

04:37.000 --> 04:39.950
Alissa likes working in the shop.

04:40.000 --> 04:42.050
She serves the customers.

04:43.000 --> 04:45.950
The customers are rich ladies.

04:46.000 --> 04:48.950
They buy expensive dresses.

04:50.000 --> 04:53.950
One of the customers is a tall and pretty lady.

04:54.000 --> 04:56.900
She always smiles at Alissa.

04:57.500 --> 05:01.000
She gives Alissa small presents.

05:05.800 --> 05:09.950
One day, the tall lady leaves her purse in the shop.

05:10.000 --> 05:12.800
Alissa runs out into the street.

05:13.000 --> 05:14.950 
She runs after the lady.

05:15.000 --> 05:18.950
Here is your purse. Alissa says.
 
05:19.000 --> 05:21.680
The lady smiles.

05:22.000 --> 05:27.340
She takes the money from the purse. Thank you. She says to Alissa.
 
05:27.400 --> 05:29.910
You are an honest girl.

05:30.000 --> 05:31.950
Take this money.

05:32.000 --> 05:34.900
No. No. Says Alissa.
  
05:35.000 --> 05:37.350
I don't want your money.

05:37.800 --> 05:40.000
She runs back to the shop.

05:40.500 --> 05:42.600
The shop owner shouts at her.

05:42.800 --> 05:46.135
Don't leave the shop again. She shouts.
 
05:46.250 --> 05:48.050
I pay you a lot of money.

05:48.150 --> 05:49.800
I pay you to work.

05:50.000 --> 05:54.950
I don't pay you to run out into the street.

05:55.000 --> 05:58.950
Alissa is angry.

05:59.000 --> 06:04.910
You don't pay me a lot of money. She shouts. I'm a slave here.
   
06:05.000 --> 06:09.250
You're an ungrateful girl. The large woman says.
  
06:09.300 --> 06:11.950
You have a bed and food and money.

06:12.000 --> 06:16.950
Do you want more? Yes, I do. Alissa says.
  
06:17.000 --> 06:19.000
She is crying now.

06:19.200 --> 06:22.800
Wait. A quiet voice.

06:23.480 --> 06:26.550
The tall lady is standing at the door.

06:27.000 --> 06:29.150
Alissa isn't ungrateful.

06:29.170 --> 06:30.950
The tall lady says.

06:31.000 --> 06:33.550
She is an honest girl.

06:34.000 --> 06:36.650
The tall lady speaks to Alissa.

06:36.700 --> 06:40.350
Aren't you happy here? She asks.
 
06:40.400 --> 06:42.200
What do you want?

06:43.000 --> 06:46.420
Alissa says. I want to go to school.
 
06:50.500 --> 06:53.600
The tall lady turns to the shop owner.

06:53.800 --> 06:58.950
Alissa will live in my house. She says. She won't work.

06:59.200 --> 07:01.250
She will go to school.
 
07:01.350 --> 07:04.950
You must pay me. The shop owner says.

07:05.000 --> 07:10.250
No. The tall lady says. Alissa isn't a slave.
  
07:10.800 --> 07:13.850
Pack your things, Alissa. She says.

07:13.920 --> 07:15.850
We will go home now.

07:16.000 --> 07:19.050
Alissa goes with the tall lady.

07:19.200 --> 07:22.500
She is going to a new home.

07:23.000 --> 07:38.500
She is going to be happy.